<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Advanced SEO Keyword Research, Competitor Analysis, and Rank Tracking Tool">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#F6F5F0">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/public/favicon.ico">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com" crossorigin>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/onpage.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/technical.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/project-dashboard.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/page-optimization.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/tasks.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/sitemap.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/autopilot.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/evidence-desk.css">

</head>
<body>
    <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>
    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <nav class="sidebar" aria-label="Primary">
        <div class="sidebar-header">
            <div class="logo">
                <span class="ed-logo-mark" aria-hidden="true">ED</span>
                <span class="logo-text">Evidence Desk</span>
            </div>
            <button class="sidebar-collapse-btn" id="sidebarCollapseBtn" title="Collapse sidebar" aria-label="Collapse sidebar" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="sidebarNav">
                <i class="fas fa-angles-left" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="ed-workspace-switcher" aria-label="Current workspace — Agency workspace">
            <span class="ed-workspace-mark" aria-hidden="true">ED</span>
            <span><strong>Agency workspace</strong><small>All clients</small></span>
            <i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </button>
        <ul class="nav-menu" id="sidebarNav">
            <li class="nav-group">
                <button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="overview" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="nav-group-overview"><span class="nav-group-label">Overview</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <ul class="nav-group-items" id="nav-group-overview">
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item active" data-page="dashboard"><i class="fas fa-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Workspace overview</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="alerts"><i class="fas fa-bell" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Alerts</span><span class="badge" id="alertBadge" aria-label="Unread alerts">0</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="autopilot"><i class="fas fa-wand-magic-sparkles" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Autopilot</span><span class="badge" aria-label="AI feature">AI</span></button></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-group collapsed" data-default="collapsed">
                <button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="projects" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-group-projects"><span class="nav-group-label">Projects</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <ul class="nav-group-items" id="nav-group-projects">
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="clients"><i class="fas fa-briefcase" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Clients</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="project-dashboard"><i class="fas fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Project dashboard</span></button></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-group collapsed" data-default="collapsed">
                <button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="work" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-group-work"><span class="nav-group-label">Core work</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <ul class="nav-group-items" id="nav-group-work">
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="research"><i class="fas fa-search" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Keyword research</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="tracking"><i class="fas fa-chart-bar" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Rank tracking</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="onpage"><i class="fas fa-file-lines" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>On-page SEO</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="technical"><i class="fas fa-spider" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Technical SEO</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="page-optimization"><i class="fas fa-bullseye" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Page optimization</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="page-speed"><i class="fas fa-gauge-high" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>PageSpeed</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="content-brief"><i class="fas fa-file-pen" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Content briefs</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="humanizer"><i class="fas fa-pen-nib" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Content humanizer</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="tasks"><i class="fas fa-list-check" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>SEO tasks</span></button></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-group collapsed" data-default="collapsed">
                <button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="delivery" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-group-delivery"><span class="nav-group-label">Delivery</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <ul class="nav-group-items" id="nav-group-delivery">
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="reports"><i class="fas fa-file-export" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Report workspace</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="gsc"><i class="fas fa-chart-column" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Search Console</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="seo-performance"><i class="fas fa-chart-line" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>SEO performance</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="search-visibility"><i class="fas fa-magnifying-glass-chart" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Search visibility</span></button></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-group collapsed" data-default="collapsed">
                <button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="tools" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-group-tools"><span class="nav-group-label">Research tools</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <ul class="nav-group-items" id="nav-group-tools">
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="clustering"><i class="fas fa-layer-group" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Keyword clustering</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="competitors"><i class="fas fa-users" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Competitors</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="analysis"><i class="fas fa-scale-balanced" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Compare &amp; analyze</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="sitemap"><i class="fas fa-sitemap" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Sitemap generator</span></button></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-group collapsed" data-default="collapsed">
                <button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="agency" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav-group-agency"><span class="nav-group-label">Agency</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <ul class="nav-group-items" id="nav-group-agency">
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="agency-settings"><i class="fas fa-building" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Settings</span></button></li>
                    <li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="agency-members"><i class="fas fa-user-group" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Team members</span></button></li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-group" style="display:none;"><button type="button" class="nav-group-header" data-group="social" aria-expanded="false"><span class="nav-group-label">Social Poster</span><i class="fas fa-chevron-down nav-group-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><ul class="nav-group-items"><li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="social-upload"><i class="fas fa-upload" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Upload</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="social-schedule"><i class="fas fa-calendar-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Schedule</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="social-platforms"><i class="fas fa-hashtag" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Platforms</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="nav-item" data-page="social-analytics"><i class="fas fa-chart-pie" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Analytics</span></button></li></ul></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="sidebar-footer">
            <div class="version" aria-label="App version">v<%= version %></div>
            <button type="button" class="nav-item logout-button" aria-label="Log out">
                <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <span class="logo-text">Logout</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Command Palette Modal -->
    <div class="command-palette-overlay" id="commandPalette" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="commandPaletteTitle">
        <div class="command-palette">
            <div class="command-palette-input-wrap">
                <i class="fas fa-search" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="commandPaletteInput" id="commandPaletteTitle" class="sr-only">Search pages and keywords</label>
                <input type="search" id="commandPaletteInput" placeholder="Search pages, keywords, commands…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" aria-label="Search pages and keywords">
                <kbd aria-hidden="true">ESC</kbd>
            </div>
            <div class="command-palette-results" id="commandPaletteResults"></div>
            <div class="command-palette-footer">
                <span><kbd>&uarr;</kbd><kbd>&darr;</kbd> navigate</span>
                <span><kbd>Enter</kbd> select</span>
                <span><kbd>Esc</kbd> close</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Sidebar Overlay for Mobile -->
    <div class="sidebar-overlay" id="sidebarOverlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Back to Top Button -->
    <button class="back-to-top" id="backToTop" title="Back to top" aria-label="Back to top">
        <i class="fas fa-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </button>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="main-content" id="main-content">
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="header">
            <div class="header-left">
                <button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="sidebarNav">
                    <i class="fas fa-bars" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                </button>
                <div class="header-title-area">
                    <nav class="breadcrumbs" id="breadcrumbs">
                        <span class="breadcrumb-item"><i class="fas fa-home"></i></span>
                    </nav>
                    <h1 id="pageTitle">Dashboard</h1>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="header-center">
                <button type="button" class="search-bar-container command-palette-trigger" id="commandPaletteTrigger" title="Search (Ctrl+K)" aria-label="Search pages and keywords (Ctrl+K)">
                    <i class="fas fa-search search-icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span class="search-hint" style="flex:1; text-align:left;">Search everything…</span>
                    <kbd aria-hidden="true">Ctrl+K</kbd>
                </button>
            </div>

            <div class="header-right">
                <div class="ed-header-context"><span class="ed-status-dot ed-status-dot-green" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Workspace live</span></div>
                <button type="button" class="header-action-btn icon-btn" id="headerSearchBtn" title="Search" aria-label="Search" style="display:none;"><i class="fas fa-search" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
                <button type="button" class="header-action-btn icon-btn" id="themeToggle" title="Toggle dark mode" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" aria-pressed="false"><i class="fas fa-moon" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Pages -->
        <div class="content" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="false" id="pageContentLive">
            <!-- Dashboard Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/dashboard') %>

            <!-- Autopilot Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/autopilot') %>

            <!-- Clients Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/clients') %>

            <!-- Project SEO Dashboard Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/project-dashboard') %>

            <!-- Keyword Research Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/research') %>

            <!-- Keyword Clustering Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/clustering') %>

            <!-- Competitors Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/competitors') %>


            <!-- Analysis Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/analysis') %>

            <!-- Rank Tracking Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/tracking') %>


            <!-- Alerts Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/alerts') %>

            <!-- On-Page SEO Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/onpage') %>

            <!-- Page Optimization Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/page-optimization') %>

            <%- include('partials/pages/page-speed') %>

            <%- include('partials/pages/technical') %>

            <!-- Content Humanizer Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/humanizer') %>

            <!-- Content Brief Page -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/content-brief') %>

            <!-- Social Poster Pages (Iframed to preserve Tailwind styles) -->
            <div class="page" id="page-social-upload" style="padding: 0; min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);">
                <iframe id="iframe-social-upload" src="" data-src="/social/posts/upload" style="width: 100%; height: calc(100vh - 60px); border: none;"></iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="page" id="page-social-schedule" style="padding: 0; min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);">
                <iframe id="iframe-social-schedule" src="" data-src="/social/posts/schedule" style="width: 100%; height: calc(100vh - 60px); border: none;"></iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="page" id="page-social-platforms" style="padding: 0; min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);">
                <iframe id="iframe-social-platforms" src="" data-src="/social/platforms" style="width: 100%; height: calc(100vh - 60px); border: none;"></iframe>
            </div>
            <div class="page" id="page-social-analytics" style="padding: 0; min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);">
                <iframe id="iframe-social-analytics" src="" data-src="/social/analytics" style="width: 100%; height: calc(100vh - 60px); border: none;"></iframe>
            </div>

            <!-- ─── SEO Tasks Page ─── -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/tasks') %>

            <!-- Task Creation / Editing Modal -->
            <div class="modal" id="taskModal">
                <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 500px;">
                    <div class="modal-header">
                        <h3 id="taskModalTitle">➕ Add Custom Task</h3>
                        <button class="modal-close" onclick="closeTaskModal()">&times;</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="modal-body">
                        <form id="taskForm" onsubmit="saveTask(event)">
                            <input type="hidden" id="taskFormId">
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="taskFormTitle" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Task title</label>
                                <input type="text" id="taskFormTitle" name="taskTitle" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="true" placeholder="e.g. Add FAQ schema to homepage…" style="width: 100%;" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="taskFormDesc" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Description</label>
                                <textarea id="taskFormDesc" name="taskDesc" spellcheck="true" placeholder="Explain what to do, target URLs, LSI keywords to add…" style="width: 100%; min-height: 80px;"></textarea>
                            </div>
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="taskFormCategory" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Category</label>
                                    <select id="taskFormCategory" name="category" style="width: 100%;">
                                        <option value="on-page">On-Page SEO</option>
                                        <option value="technical">Technical SEO</option>
                                        <option value="content">Content Strategy</option>
                                        <option value="link-building">Link Building</option>
                                        <option value="local-seo">Local SEO</option>
                                        <option value="general">General</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="taskFormPriority" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Priority</label>
                                    <select id="taskFormPriority" name="priority" style="width: 100%;">
                                        <option value="critical">🚨 Critical</option>
                                        <option value="high">🟠 High</option>
                                        <option value="medium" selected>🟡 Medium</option>
                                        <option value="low">🟢 Low</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px;">
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="taskFormImpact" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Impact</label>
                                    <select id="taskFormImpact" name="impact" style="width: 100%;">
                                        <option value="high">High</option>
                                        <option value="medium" selected>Medium</option>
                                        <option value="low">Low</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-group">
                                    <label for="taskFormEffort" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Effort</label>
                                    <select id="taskFormEffort" name="effort" style="width: 100%;">
                                        <option value="high">High</option>
                                        <option value="medium" selected>Medium</option>
                                        <option value="low">Low</option>
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-group">
                                <label for="taskFormStatus" style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Status</label>
                                <select id="taskFormStatus" name="status" style="width: 100%;">
                                    <option value="todo" selected>To Do</option>
                                    <option value="in_progress">In Progress</option>
                                    <option value="completed">Completed</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; gap: 12px; margin-top: 20px;">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" onclick="closeTaskModal()">Cancel</button>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save Task</button>
                            </div>
                        </form>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- ─── Search Console (GSC) Page ─── -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/gsc') %><!-- end #page-gsc -->

            <%- include('partials/pages/seo-performance') %>



            <%- include('partials/pages/search-visibility') %>

            <!-- ─── Agency Settings Page ─── -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/agency-settings') %>

            <!-- ─── Agency Members Page ─── -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/agency-members') %>

            <!-- ─── Reports Page ─── -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/reports') %>

            <!-- ===== Sitemap Generator Page ===== -->
            <%- include('partials/pages/sitemap') %>
            <!-- ===== /Sitemap Generator Page ===== -->

        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Competitor Analysis Modal -->
    <div class="modal" id="competitorAnalysisModal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="competitorModalTitle">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h3 id="competitorModalTitle">Page Analysis</h3>
                <button type="button" class="modal-close" aria-label="Close dialog">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body" id="competitorAnalysisContent"></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Loading Overlay -->
    <div class="loading-overlay" id="loadingOverlay" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true">
        <div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p id="loadingText">Analyzing…</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="ed-evidence-drawer" id="evidenceDrawer" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="evidenceDrawerTitle" inert>
        <div class="ed-drawer-header"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">Evidence desk</p><h2 id="evidenceDrawerTitle">How this workspace reports truth</h2></div><button class="ed-icon-button" id="closeEvidenceDrawer" type="button" aria-label="Close evidence panel"><i class="fas fa-xmark" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div>
        <div class="ed-drawer-body" id="evidenceDrawerBody"><p>Every result should carry its context, source, freshness, and next action. Missing or stale data stays visible so an analyst can decide what to do next.</p><div class="ed-drawer-rule"><span class="ed-status-dot ed-status-dot-green" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><strong>Measured</strong><small>Directly returned from a connected or stored source.</small></div></div><div class="ed-drawer-rule"><span class="ed-status-dot ed-status-dot-amber" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><strong>Proxy</strong><small>Derived from another source and labelled before it reaches a report.</small></div></div><div class="ed-drawer-rule"><span class="ed-status-dot ed-status-dot-neutral" aria-hidden="true"></span><div><strong>Not collected</strong><small>Not enough evidence yet. The interface will not fill the gap with a guess.</small></div></div></div>
    </aside>
    <div class="ed-drawer-overlay" id="evidenceDrawerOverlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Toast Notifications -->
    <div class="toast-container" id="toastContainer" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>

    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jsdiff/5.2.0/diff.min.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/app.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/onpage.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/technical.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/contentBrief.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/project-dashboard.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/page-optimization.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/reports.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/seo-performance.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/search-visibility.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/tasks.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/agency.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/sitemap.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/sitemap-reports.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/autopilot.js"></script>
    <script src="/public/js/evidence-desk.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
